@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+---
+id: task-002-add-rental-availability-query
+type: task
+title: "Add rental availability query"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+## Work completed
+
+Added `availability(query)` to the in-memory rental service. It validates the requested UTC rental
+period and optional `board` or `sail` kind, then returns lexically sorted IDs whose bookings do not
+overlap the requested interval. The implementation uses the service's existing inclusive-start,
+exclusive-end overlap rule, so adjacent rentals remain available.
+
+Added red-first tests for all-kind and kind-filtered results, ordering, occupied equipment, adjacent
+bookings, and malformed queries. Updated the public API documentation.
